.*                                                                      01250064
.*       . INITIALIZE THE INTERNAL PARAMETERS REQUIRED FOR              01300064
.*         SUCCESSFUL OPERATION OF THE INTERNAL MACROS.                 01350064
.*                                                                      01400064
