.*         LINKEDIT STEPS FOR THE ALLOCATION TABLES.                    01500064
.*                                                                      01550064
.* NOTES - N/A                                                          01600064
.*                                                                      01650064
.* DEPENDENCIES -                                                       01700064
.*            . THE SGIEI1IO INTERNAL MACRO DOES NOT REQUIRE ANY        01750064
.*              INPUT EXCEPT:                                           01800064
